# M2: bulleted, numbered and lettered lists read from RTF, then Bullets on the last paragraph and Enter on an empty item.
@copy lists.rtf
@open LISTS.RTF
pagedown
f10 right right right right right down down down down enter   # Paragraph > Bullets
end enter enter                                    # a new bullet, then Enter on the empty one ends the list
x
f10 end enter
n
